  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Evaluations 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Evaluations&#xa0;of&#xa0;Pacific and Development Group (PDG) programmes are intended to provide independent scrutiny and assessment of the International Development Cooperation&apos;s performance and identify lessons for improvement. Strategic Evaluations are conducted across areas of strategic importance for&#xa0;PDG to inform future planning for development effectiveness and impact, and to provide evidence for&#xa0;insights products across the International Development Cooperation programme.</narrative>
  </description>
